.Dd July 9, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go
.Nd Reticulum network stack daemon and tools
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar command
.Op Ar flags
.Nm
.Cm daemon
.Nm
.Cm status | id | probe | path | cp | pageserver
.Op Ar flags
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a Go implementation of the Reticulum Network Stack.
A single binary provides the network daemon and operator tools as subcommands.
.Pp
With no command, or with
.Cm daemon ,
the process loads configuration from
.Pa ~/.reticulum-go/config
(created on first run) and runs as a shared-instance owner or client according
to that config.
.Pp
Legacy tool names
.Nm rgostatus , rgoid , rgoprobe , rgopath , rgocp ,
and
.Nm rgopageserver
may be installed as symlinks to this binary.
When invoked under those names, the matching subcommand is selected automatically.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width pageserver
.It Cm daemon
Run the network daemon (default).
.It Cm status
Interface and transport status via shared-instance RPC.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-status 1 .
.It Cm id
Identities, destination hashes, signing and encryption.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-id 1 .
.It Cm probe
Encrypted probe packets and RTT.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-probe 1 .
.It Cm path
Path table, drop, and blackhole management.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-path 1 .
.It Cm cp
File transfer over Reticulum links.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-cp 1 .
.It Cm pageserver
NomadNet-style page and file server.
See
.Xr reticulum-go-pageserver 1 .
.El
.Sh GLOBAL OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--version"
.It Fl h , -help
Print help and exit.
.It Fl v , -version
Print version and exit.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "~/.reticulum-go/storage/"
.It Pa ~/.reticulum-go/config
Default configuration file.
.It Pa ~/.reticulum-go/storage/
Identities, path table, and related state.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 8 ,
.Xr reticulum-go-status 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go-id 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go-probe 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go-path 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go-cp 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go-pageserver 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Quad4.io
